flowchart TB
  subgraph Before[Observed baseline]
    LegacyClient[Client] --> LegacyApi[.NET 6 API]
    LegacyApi --> LegacyService[Coupled Orders + Inventory + Fulfillment]
    LegacyService --> LegacyDb[(Shared database)]
  end

  Assess[Assess evidence] --> Plan[Plan reversible slices]
  Plan --> Execute[Execute one boundary]
  Execute --> Validate[Validate behavior and failure]

  Before --> Assess
  Validate --> After

  subgraph After[Contract-compatible target]
    NewClient[Same client] --> Edge[External Edge API]
    Edge --> Orders[Internal Orders API]
    Edge --> Inventory[Internal Inventory API]
    Edge --> Fulfillment[Internal Fulfillment API]
    Orders --> Inventory
    Fulfillment --> Orders
    Fulfillment --> Inventory
    Orders --> OrdersDb[(Orders DB)]
    Inventory --> InventoryDb[(Inventory DB)]
    Fulfillment --> FulfillmentDb[(Fulfillment DB)]
  end

  Characterization[Characterization tests] -. baseline .-> Assess
  Contract[Legacy vs Edge contract tests] -. parity .-> Validate
  ServiceTests[Per-service tests] -. ownership and idempotency .-> Validate
  FailureTests[Unavailable-service tests] -. 503 semantics .-> Validate
  Compose[Container smoke] -. real boundaries .-> Validate
  Bicep[Static Bicep build and lint] -. reference-IaC evidence .-> Validate
